rex\b0 \highlight\uc2  anymore due to mounting pressure from overseas; Reuters reports former top MOF official Naoyuki Shinohara said little point in Japan trying to guide USD/JPY higher as U.S., European policy to remain loose. (takashi.mochizuki@dowjones.com) [ 10-07-10 0048ET ]\par \par \uc2 4022   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020101007e6a700033\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
