\par\par \b \uc2 =DJ FOCUS: Showdown Looms For Japan's  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Policy\b0\par\par\uc2 By Clare Connaghan  \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES  \par \uc2 521 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Oktober 2010\par 15:14\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2010, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 LONDON (Dow Jones)--It is crunch time for Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy.\par \par \uc2 Tuesday's salvo of fresh monetary easing measures have failed to knock the sky-high yen back down, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is now hovering right at the level where the Bank Of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , on the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 's behalf, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily last month to push it back down.\par \par \uc2 Market watchers say the Japanese authorities must step back in now to retain credibility in the increasingly heated international \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  wars.\par \par \uc2 "Having \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in September, pressure on the yen would no doubt increase considerably if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained inactive now, as market participants would think that the BOJ has given up," said \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategists at \uc2 Commerzbank\uc2  in a note. "But the BOJ cannot afford to give up... The showdown is approaching."\par \par \uc2 Japan launched a super-sized zap on the sky-high yen for the first time in six years on Sept. 15, selling Y2 trillion ($24 billion) to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down. That sting, which was designed to deflect deflationary pressures, pushed the dollar up from under Y83 to almost Y86--a level it held for almost a week.\par \par \uc2 But the yen has moved steadily higher since then as investors dumped dollars in anticipation of further easing of U.S. monetary policy.\par \par \uc2 Even Tuesday's deflation-fighting combination of lower interest rates and a new asset-buying program failed to halt the rise, with the yen moving lower only temporarily before resuming its upward trend. Wednesday, the dollar charted a fresh 15-year low against the yen, at Y82.75.\par \par \uc2 The market is now back in the increasingly familiar mode of waiting for the BOJ to pounce again.\par \par \uc2 "We have always argued that Japan needs to be fast and furious," said Paul Mackel, a \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at \uc2 HSBC\uc2  in London. "If the market starts to believe that the BOJ will not step in, then it could really give them a strong run higher in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 One reason why the Japanese authorities haven't taken action already may be that they are waiting for this weekend's International Monetary Fund meeting, where they will have the opportunity to explain their actions to the international community in order to gain support, or at least to dodge criticism.\par \par \uc2 "They could put forward the case that they have already driven bond yields down to extremely low levels so further asset purchases probably won't have too much impact, therefore another way of getting liquidity into the system is via the exchange rate" said Ian Stannard, a \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at French bank \uc2 BNP Paribas\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "They can make a fairly good case that they're not manipulating their \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and they're \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  as broader monetary policy to slow the pace of appreciation in the yen," he added.\par \par \uc2 At 1313 GMT, the dollar was trading at Y82.93.\par \par \uc2 -By Clare Connaghan, Dow Jones Newswires; +44 (0) 20 7842 9496, clare.connaghan@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 October 06, 2010 09:14 ET (13:14 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020101006e6a6002x6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
