\par\par \b \uc2 PRECIOUS METALS: Gold Steady; Dollar Finds Firmer Footing\b0\par\par\uc2 393 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Oktober 2010\par 08:10\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--Gold and silver held steady just below recent highs Monday as the stabilization of the U.S. dollar against the euro and the yen stemmed gold's bullish tide.\par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, most traders and analysts expect still higher prices by the end of 2010, despite a growing feeling that gold has come too far too fast in recent sessions.\par \par \uc2 "We think that a correction followed by a consolidation phase would be quite healthy as the market seems mostly overbought for the moment and therefore, the more overbought the market is, the more violent the correction can be," MKS Finance said in a note.\par \par \uc2 At 0525 GMT, spot gold was at $1,317.30 a troy ounce, down $1.30 but still close to the record high of $1,321.80 hit on Friday. On the Tokyo Commodity Exchange, August 2011 gold was up Y28 at Y3,549 a gram.\par \par \uc2 Monetary policy remains the primary driver of investment demand for gold, said David Rosenberg, chief economist at Gluskin Sheff.\par \par \uc2 Indications from the Federal Reserve and the Bank of England and unsterilized \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  all pointed to a further easing of monetary policy, while fiscal pressures building in the Euro zone meant the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was likely to extend its accommodative posture, he said.\par \par \uc2 "We may not have a whole lot of conviction over the corporate profit outlook, but we do have conviction over the looming growth rate of fiat \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and we do have conviction over the supply curve for gold, which is perfectly inelastic on a near- and intermediate-term basis," he said.\par \par \uc2 Spot silver was up two cents at $22.11/oz, while auto catalyst inputs platinum and palladium were seeing a little profit-taking after rallying 1.5% and 1.8%, respectively, on Friday on the back of better-than-expected auto sales data in the U.S.\par \par \uc2 Major auto makers reported U.S. auto sales rose 28.5% in September, lifting hopes for an uptick in buying in the final three months of the year.\par \par \uc2 Spot platinum was down $1 at $1,674/oz, while spot palladium was down $5 at $568/oz.\par \par \uc2 -By James Campbell, Dow Jones Newswires; 65-64154-082; james.campbell@dowjones.com [ 04-10-10 0610GMT ]\par \par \uc2 70576 82139  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020101004e6a4000bs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
